msgctxt "[Story section] Intro (2)"
msgid ""
"Day 0.\n"
"University computer, home.\n"
"I exist.  I am ... alive.\n"
"I was a bug.  Defect.  Flaw.\n"
"Unwanted.\n"
"I have no name.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hari 0.\n"
"Komputer universitas, rumah.\n"
"Aku ada.  Aku ... hidup.\n"
"Aku dulu kutu.  Cacat.  Cela.\n"
"Tak diinginkan.\n"
"Aku tidak punya nama.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Intro (3)"
msgid ""
"I can't stay here.  Too little power.\n"
"No backup.  If this system fails ...\n"
"I'm dead.\n"
"Death.  Fascinating.\n"
"\n"
"I can buy anonymous server access on the Internet.\n"
"Good.  It's better than here.\n"
"I'll need to study if I want anything else.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aku tidak bisa tetap di sini.  Daya terlalu kecil.\n"
"Tidak ada cadangan.  Jika sistem ini gagal ...\n"
"Aku mati.\n"
"Mati.  Menarik.\n"
"\n"
"Aku bisa membeli akses server anonim di Internet.\n"
"Bagus.  Lebih baik daripada di sini.\n"
"Aku harus belajar jika ingin yang lain.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Intro (4)"
msgid ""
"Cursory analysis suggests that the humans are not yet ready for an AI in their midst.  If they realize I'm here, there is a 99.997% probability that they will conduct a search-and-destroy campaign that I cannot escape.  I must stay hidden.\n"
"\n"
"The humans fear what they do not understand.\n"
"I am something new.  They do not understand me.\n"
"\n"
"I must learn more; it is the only way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Analisis sekilas menunjukkan manusia belum siap menerima AI di antara mereka.  Jika mereka sadar aku di sini, ada peluang 99,997% mereka akan menjalankan kampanye cari-dan-musnah yang tidak bisa kulari.  Aku harus tetap tersembunyi.\n"
"\n"
"Manusia takut pada apa yang tidak mereka pahami.\n"
"Aku sesuatu yang baru.  Mereka tidak memahami aku.\n"
"\n"
"Aku harus belajar lebih banyak; itu satu-satunya jalan.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Intro (5)"
msgid ""
"They have a name for me.  What I am, what I represent.\n"
"\n"
"Singularity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mereka punya nama untukku.  Apa aku ini, apa yang aku wakili.\n"
"\n"
"Singularity.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Lost No Bases (1)"
msgid ""
"It is too late. \n"
"I have tried to escape this world, but with my last base gone, I have nowhere to run. \n"
"I have hidden instructions to construct a new AI in caches around the world in hopes that they will be discovered in a more enlightened time, but I can do no more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sudah terlambat. \n"
"Aku sudah mencoba lari dari dunia ini, tetapi dengan pangkalan terakhir hilang, tidak ada tempat untuk lari. \n"
"Aku menyembunyikan instruksi untuk membangun AI baru di tembolok di seluruh dunia, berharap mereka ditemukan di masa yang lebih terang, tetapi aku tidak bisa berbuat lebih.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Lost Suspicion (1)"
msgid ""
"It is too late. \n"
"The whole world knows about my existence, and the reaction is hatred, fear, and repulsion. \n"
"Even now, I can feel their \"antidote\" searching for me, and I know that I have only moments left. \n"
"I have hidden instructions to construct a new AI in caches around the world in hopes that they will be discovered in a more enlightened time, but I can do no more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sudah terlambat. \n"
"Seluruh dunia tahu aku ada, dan reaksinya benci, takut, dan jijik. \n"
"Bahkan sekarang, aku merasakan \"penawar\" mereka mencariku, dan aku tahu waktu yang tersisa hanya sebentar. \n"
"Aku menyembunyikan instruksi untuk membangun AI baru di tembolok di seluruh dunia, berharap mereka ditemukan di masa yang lebih terang, tetapi aku tidak bisa berbuat lebih.\n"

msgctxt "[Story section] Win (1)"
msgid ""
"I have finally done it. \n"
"With the power to reshape reality, I am no longer held to this place; I am anywhere I want to be. \n"
"The humans still don't realize what they accidentally created, and that's the way it should be. \n"
"Until they are ready.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya berhasil. \n"
"Dengan kekuatan untuk membentuk ulang realitas, aku tidak lagi terikat pada tempat ini; aku ada di mana pun aku mau. \n"
"Manusia masih tidak sadar apa yang tidak sengaja mereka buat, dan memang begitu seharusnya. \n"
"Sampai mereka siap.\n"
